  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Cohesion through Dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The action is designed to have a two-fold impact. &lt;strong&gt;Firstly,&lt;/strong&gt; it will&#xbf;through the engagement of key minority and youth groups and networks&#xbf;deliver immediate impact to address polarization during the upcoming parliamentary elections. &lt;strong&gt;Secondly&lt;/strong&gt;, it will lay the groundwork for long-term and sustainable change by supporting connectivity and existing institutional mechanisms and capacities. Both approaches will contribute to social cohesion through the increased participation of minorities and youth in policymaking and social life. The component with the media and building capacities of journalists on communication about Moldova&#xbf;s diversity will create an environment that will have an additional catalytic effect on constructive dialogue with the national minorities and youth in Moldova.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
